# Modern B&B PDF style

**From August 2026 forward, every Burn & Build PDF uses the modern report style.** The **Food Plan** page is the design reference — gold/black Montserrat layout with personalized header and three-column footer.

The **Burn & Build Diet PDF** (7 pages) and **Burn & Build FAQ** (standalone) are separate deliverables. FAQ is **not** bundled inside the diet PDF.

## PDF deliverables (naming)

| Product | User-facing name | Download filename | Repo file | API slug |
|---------|------------------|-------------------|-----------|----------|
| Personalized diet | Burn & Build Diet | `Burn&Build-{Name}-{date}.pdf` | `docs/samples/b&bsamplediet.pdf` (sample only) | `sample-diet` / `programs/diet-pdf` |
| Menu Plan worksheet | Burn & Build Menu Plan | `menu-plan-worksheet.pdf` | `docs/samples/menu-plan-worksheet.pdf` | `menu-plan-worksheet` |
| FAQ PDF | **Burn & Build FAQ** | `Burn & Build FAQ.pdf` | `docs/samples/burn-and-build-faq.pdf` | `burn-and-build-faq` |
| Purchase email preview | Burn & Build Purchase Email | `burn-and-build-purchase-email.html` | `docs/samples/burn-and-build-purchase-email.html` | `burn-and-build-purchase-email` |

FAQ rules: `.cursor/rules/burn-and-build-faq-pdf.mdc`. Purchase email: `.cursor/rules/burn-and-build-purchase-email.mdc`. Sample diet: `.cursor/rules/sample-diet-pdf.mdc`.

Do not add new pages in the legacy seminar wireframe (`SEMINAR_COLORS`, old locked-preview tables, HTML print paths). Extend the modern family instead.

## Canonical reference

| What | Path |
|------|------|
| **Design anchor** | `server/pdf/drawModernFoodPlanPage.js` — Food Plan page |
| **Shared frame** | `server/pdf/drawModernReportFrame.js` — fonts, colors, header, footer |
| **Page bootstrap** | `server/pdf/draw1982Frame.js` → `begin1982Page()` |
| **Renderer entry** | `server/pdf/renderSampleDietPrintout.js` |

When in doubt, match Food Plan: typography scale, gold accents, table treatment, and content padding above the footer.

## Visual system

| Token | Value / rule |
|-------|----------------|
| **Fonts** | Montserrat (`MODERN_REPORT_FONTS` in `drawModernReportFrame.js`) |
| **Body text** | `#111111` |
| **Muted text** | `#5C5C5C` |
| **Brand gold** | `#FFCC00` — page-title accent word, section rules, table borders |
| **Gold panels** | `#FFFBE6` (`goldPale`) — highlighted table rows, dashboard center |
| **Page title** | Last word gold, preceding words black; gold rule beneath |
| **Header** | Logo left · `PERSONALIZED FOR: NAME · DATE` right |
| **Footer** | Page X of Y left · website center · email right |

