## Agent checklist

1. **Frame** — start every page with `begin1982Page(doc, payload, pageTitle)`; continuation pages pass `null` for `pageTitle`.
2. **Fonts** — call `registerModernReportFonts(doc)` before drawing body content.
3. **Footer reserve** — pin body content above `modernFooterRuleY()` (typically 36pt reserve).
4. **Copy** — user-authored text stays verbatim (see `.cursor/rules/user-authored-copy.mdc`); change layout only.
5. **Cache bust** — layout/copy-pipeline changes → bump `DIET_PDF_GENERATION_VERSION` in `js/assetVersionData.js`.
6. **Verify** — `npm run verify:pdf` and `npm run verify:printout-calcs`.
7. **Review PDFs** — run the matching `npm run render:*` script, commit `docs/samples/<repo-file>.pdf`, push to `main`, then share the live API URL (see deliverables table above). Never give users `/opt/cursor/artifacts/` paths.

## Do not reintroduce

- Legacy seminar PDF styling (`drawSeminar.js` colors as primary page design)
- Old 12-page program report renderer (`renderProgramReportLockedPreview.js` — deleted)
- HTML print-shop PDF paths
- Non-Montserrat fonts on report pages (Barlow, Caveat except Menu Plan handwriting fill-ins)
